# pdcm-make-cards.ti59  Writes the two magnetic cards of PDCM, the card-swapping
# system from CHIP 8/1979, as if they had been keyed in and saved by hand.
# Run it once, then follow PDCM-Emulator.md, next to this file.
#
# It creates two card files in the card folder. Running it again rewrites both
# strips on each of them. Nothing else in the folder changes.
#   PDCM-1.U59  side 1: strip 11.-03   (listing a, 000-239, bank 1)
#               side 2: strip -998.-03 (listing a, 240-435, bank 2)
#   PDCM-2.U59  side 1: strip -999.-03 (listing c, bank 3)
#               side 2: strip 1.-03    (listing b, bank 1)

